<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 185.879 bln esc fixed 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 185.879 bln esc fixed 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 185.879 billion escudos of seven-day funds at a fixed interest rate of 7.00 percent effective at the start of the next commercial bank reserve period on Monday.</p>
</text>
